{% look like this
and span multiple lines %}

{#ident % later we'll add a class %}

### Symbols

My reaction is :+1: :smiley:.

### Raw inline

This is `<?php echo 'Hello world!' ?>`{=html}.

There's also raw block.

### Span

This is [a span]{.some-class #some-id some-key="some val"}.

### Inline Attributes

An attribute on _emphasized text_{#foo
.bar .baz key="my value"}

avant{lang=fr}{.blue}

avant{lang=fr .blue}

